		{
			dependencies: ["69574BA63A9F05E8"]
			description: [
				"&7The Faceless One has been captured and trapped inside Vaaz, S'kellak interrogated it."
				""
				"&9\"C' mgepmgah, llll h', c'den ephaiagl ot e'enhe, ymg' ahorna mgah ahf''s nog, ymg' ahorna mgah uh'eog ph'nglui turor\" &e&oThe Faceless said, in an unknown tongue"
				""
				"&6“孩子，如果上面说的是真的，那么我们的战争才刚刚开始。”&e&oS'kellak 担忧地说道。"
				""
				"&8&o在末地的深处，裂隙闭合，一个黑暗传送门开启。"
				""
				"&8英语"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&7El Ignoto 已被捕获并困在 Vaaz 中，S'kellak 正在审问他。"
				""
				"&9\"C' mgepmgah, llll h', c'den ephaiagl ot e'enhe, ymg' ahorna mgah ahf''s nog, ymg' ahorna mgah uh'eog ph'nglui turor\" &e&oDijo el Ignoto, en una lengua desconocida."
				""
				"&6\"Mi joven, si lo que dice es cierto, entonces nuestra guerra apenas comienza.\" &e&oDijo S'kellak, preocupado."
				""
				"&8&oEn lo profundo del End, la grieta se cierra, y un portal oscuro se abre."
				""
				"&8西班牙语"
			]
